@anthropic-ai/sandbox-runtime
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`packages/cowcat/src/adapters/sandbox/backends/seatbelt.ts` contains a macOS
Seatbelt (sandbox profile) runtime allow-list transcribed from the reference
implementation published as `@anthropic-ai/sandbox-runtime`, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes made to that material:

  * the sysctl names and mach-lookup global names are kept as explicit enumerated
    lists rather than being widened to wildcards, so that widening them later is a
    reviewable change;
  * the surrounding profile assembly (rule ordering, the root-inode allowance, the
    move-blocking denies and the tail block for denied paths inside write roots) is
    assembled locally and follows the seven Seatbelt semantics documented at the top
    of that file;
  * the runtime list itself is unchanged in substance — it is verified for real by the
    `packages/cowcat · node 22 · macos-15` CI leg, because getting it wrong is a
    silent SIGABRT before exec rather than a permission error.

